p.src:
The contrast is sharp: $\text{doing} \neq \text{``I will do''}.$ The phrase I will do already opens psychological time. It has moved away from the fact and into postponement. Krishnamurti’s stronger claim is $\text{clear seeing}
\Longrightarrow
\text{immediate action}.$

