p.src:
Krishnamurti calls this irresponsibility: $\text{delegated responsibility}
\Longrightarrow
\text{irresponsibility}.$ Responsibility means total commitment to the challenge. A challenge is new; otherwise it is not a challenge. A crisis is new; otherwise it is not a crisis. Therefore the past cannot respond adequately to it.

